flowchart TD
  Session[Session menu: Debug tools] --> Dialog[Scene-owned modal, button signals only]
  Dialog --> Main[Main resolves CURRENT session model per click]
  Main --> Debug[RearDebugActions: explicit debug commands]
  Debug --> Deliver[Receiving: finish pending inbound resource orders]
  Debug --> People[Force delivery also finishes pending personnel orders]
  People --> SamePeople[Dispatch once if needed, move same remaining passengers to Personnel]
  SamePeople --> Arrive[Use normal person-arrival ownership/duty boundary]
  Arrive --> Clear[Remove only completed passenger walks, release population and vehicle reservations]
  Deliver --> Claims[Release unload claims, deposit actual carried and onboard stock once]
  Claims --> Ledger[Ledger debug transfer: preserve quantity, ownership and clear carry safely]
  Deliver --> Complete[Terminal order, release admission and schedules; no time jump]
  Debug --> Resources[Create zero-cost orders for nine raw types x1000]
  Resources --> Deliver
  Debug --> Build[Construction: pending sites only]
  Build --> Cancel[Cancel incoming hauls safely, release builders]
  Cancel --> Material[Consume remaining build materials, grant only missing debug amount]
  Material --> Activate[Reuse ordinary facility activation, stores, jobs and service registration]
  Debug --> Storage[Finite debug overflow store at Supply Table, grows only on command]
  Main --> Refresh[Existing after_command and notify_command invalidate planning and refresh views]
  Refresh --> Mark[Mark modified session DEBUG; new game resets]
